# Outfit head: steel war-correspondent helmet with an accent band and a PRESS card in paper (R23).
# Regridded to 5 cm voxels (R1 floor, CP7).
name outfit_helmet
grid 5
size 7 7 4
slot shell SwatchMain
slot band SwatchAccent
slot card Paper
ellipsoid 3 3 1 3 3 2 shell
carve box 0 0 0 6 6 0
box 0 0 0 6 6 2 band
box 5 2 1 7 4 3 card
pivot 3 3 0
